---
layout: default
title: Friends I love to train with
---

<div class="page mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <header class="mb-16 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="page-title mb-8 mt-0">Friends I love to train with.</h1>
    <p class="mb-0 text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-slate-100 sm:text-2xl">These are the instructors I recommend. Wherever you are, train with them.</p>
  </header>

  <h2 id="phuket" class="page-display mb-10 mt-0 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Phuket</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/ben.jpg" alt="Benoit Piguet" width="463" height="462" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Benoit Piguet</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/0xyben" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@0xyben</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor Trainer</li>
          <li>Certified Yoga Instructor</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Benoit travelled the world for twelve years. Freediving, which he found on a trip to Thailand in 2019, is what made him settle down.</p>
        <p class="page-prose">He practises breath-hold and yoga together, and each one feeds the other.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">On his days off he trains static, his favourite discipline.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/court.jpg" alt="Court Burgon" width="799" height="799" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Court Burgon</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/burgon_underwater" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@burgon_underwater</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 2 Instructor</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Court studied zoology and moved to Phuket in 2017 to work in the water. More than a thousand hours as a scuba and freediving instructor have taught Court the local reef inside out.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Court teaches freediving, scuba and swimming to adults and kids, in relaxed and safe sessions.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/victoria.jpg" alt="Victoria Fawcus-Robinson" width="1070" height="2400" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Victoria Fawcus-Robinson</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/barefootblondiephuket" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@barefootblondiephuket</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://scubanicks.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">ScubaNicks</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>SSI Senior Instructor</li>
          <li>Freediving Instructor</li>
          <li>Mermaid Instructor</li>
          <li>SSI Scuba Explorer Instructor (kids)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Victoria started diving in 2015 and went pro in 2018. She is now Senior Instructor at ScubaNicks in Rawai, teaching every level up to dive professional.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">She switches easily between freediving, scuba and mermaiding. She is patient with kids and first-timers and stays right beside them in the water.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/tony.jpg" alt="Tony Myshlyaev" width="532" height="530" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Tony Myshlyaev</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/tones.of.blue" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@tones.of.blue</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://namafreediving.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Nama Freediving</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor</li>
          <li>Underwater photographer</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Thirteen years underwater, camera in hand. Tony taught freediving on Koh Tao for seven years before moving to Phuket in 2022.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">His photographer&rsquo;s eye shows in his coaching: body position, movement, wasted effort. He works with divers of every level.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id="bali" class="page-display mb-10 mt-20 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Bali</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/yan.jpg" alt="Yan Tychkovskyi" width="960" height="960" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Yan Tychkovskyi</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://www.balifreedivers.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">Bali Freedivers</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/balifreedivers.amed" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">@balifreedivers.amed</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Amed</span></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>SSI Level 3</li>
          <li>Molchanovs</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Yan is Ukrainian and has been in the water since he was five. He moved to Indonesia in 2013 and has since taught more than five hundred students across five countries.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">He runs Bali Freedivers in Amed and works mostly with beginners. He shapes each course around what you do in the water, spearfishing or surfing, and teaches the breathing and safety skills that hold up when things get tight.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id="dahab" class="page-display mb-10 mt-20 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Dahab</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/roman.jpg" alt="Roman Garaikhanov" width="700" height="1120" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Roman Garaikhanov</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/roman_gara" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@roman_gara</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://molchanova.school" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Molchanova Freediving School</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 3 Instructor</li>
          <li>Molchanovs Kids Instructor L1 &amp; L2</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Roman grew up in the water and swam competitively for his city team before freediving took over.</p>
        <p class="page-prose">He still competes and keeps refining his own diving while he coaches. He is certified to teach adults (Wave 3) and kids (L1 &amp; L2) in the Molchanovs system, and he is an experienced safety diver.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">He organises the amateur <em>I Love Freediving</em> competitions and is sports manager at the Natalia Molchanova Freediving School.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id="moscow" class="page-display mb-10 mt-20 text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Moscow</h2>

  <div class="grid gap-20">
    <article class="friend grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:gap-10">
      <img src="/images/artur.jpg" alt="Artur Tikhonov" width="912" height="1332" loading="lazy" class="friend-photo">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h3 class="mb-1 mt-0 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Artur Tikhonov</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-base font-bold [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><a href="https://instagram.com/artur_tichonov" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sky-700 no-underline hover:text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 dark:hover:text-sky-200">@artur_tichonov</a><span class="mx-2 text-slate-400">·</span><a href="https://molchanova.school" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-slate-600 no-underline hover:text-slate-950 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-100">Molchanova Freediving School</a></p>
        <ul class="home-creds">
          <li>Molchanovs Wave 2 Instructor</li>
          <li>Freediving rescue &amp; first aid</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="page-prose">Artur is a competitive finswimmer turned freediving instructor, with national titles in both bi-fins and monofin.</p>
        <p class="page-prose mb-0">Personal bests: 248 m bi-fins, 227 m monofin, 161 m breaststroke and a 7:24 static. He teaches Wave 1 and Wave 2 in the pool and is a certified freediving rescue and first-aid specialist.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>
